  "description": "The MaxMind IP lookup integration, titled **MaxMindIPLookup**, is currently enabled and provided by the vendor **com.maxmind**. It is configured to use a set of MaxMind database files, each retrieved from the CDN at the URLs listed below.\n\n- **Domain** data:\u202f*GeoIPDomain.dat* \u2013\u202fhttps://cdn.maxmind.com/GeoIPDomain.dat  \n- **Geolocation** data:\u202f*GeoLiteCity.dat* \u2013\u202fhttps://cdn.maxmind.com/GeoLiteCity.dat  \n- **ISP** data:\u202f*GeoIPISP.dat* \u2013\u202fhttps://cdn.maxmind.com/GeoIPISP.dat  \n- **Netspeed** data:\u202f*GeoIPNetSpeed.dat* \u2013\u202fhttps://cdn.maxmind.com/GeoIPNetSpeed.dat  \n- **Organization** data:\u202f*GeoIPOrg.dat* \u2013\u202fhttps://cdn.maxmind.com/GeoIPOrg.dat",
